//! In-process fault-injection transport, for exercising RPC failure modes without a node.
//!
//! The retry/failover layer is the bot's only defence against a lagging, lying or
//! rate-limiting endpoint, and every one of those conditions is impractical to produce
//! against a real anvil devnet. This module implements a [`tower::Service`] with the same
//! shape alloy's real HTTP transport has (`Service<RequestPacket, Response = ResponsePacket,
//! Error = TransportError, Future = TransportFut<'static>>`), so a `DynProvider` can be built
//! on top of it and driven through the production code paths unmodified.
//!
//! A near-identical copy lives in `tests/fake_rpc/mod.rs` for the integration tests; the
//! duplication is deliberate, so that `tests/` never depends on `#[cfg(test)]` internals of
//! the library and no test-only plumbing leaks into the crate's public API.

